 {page==='dashboard-campus'&&show('register')&&<div className="bi-panel"><h2>Campus academic register</h2><div className="teacher-actions"><span>Selected cohort: {stream} · Year {year} · {batch} · {selected.length} learners</span><a className="btn outline" href={hrefFor('paper-lab')}>Question-paper lab →</a><a className="btn outline" href={hrefFor('exam')}>Assessment preview →</a></div><p>Centre Head review of consolidated sample records. In production, faculty submit their own records for verification. Here, edits are shared with founder and parent reports in this session; only the selected subject mark is edited.</p><label>Subject <select value={teacherSubject} onChange={e=>setTeacherSubject(Number(e.target.value))}>{subjects[stream].map((t,i)=><option key={t} value={i}>{t}</option>)}</select></label><div className="bi-table tall"><table><thead><tr><th>Learner</th><th>Present / 30</th><th>Subject marks / 100</th><th>Feedback</th></tr></thead><tbody>{selected.map(s=><tr key={s.id}><td>{s.id}</td><td><input type="number" aria-label={s.id+' attendance'} min="0" max="30" value={s.present[week]} onChange={e=>{const v=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(30,Number(e.target.value))));setLearners(prev=>prev.map(x=>x.id===s.id?{...x,present:x.present.map((p,i)=>i===week?v:p)}:x))}}/></td><td><input type="number" aria-label={s.id+' mark'} min="0" max="100" value={s.marks[week][teacherSubject]} onChange={e=>{const v=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(100,Number(e.target.value))));setLearners(prev=>prev.map(x=>x.id===s.id?{...x,marks:x.marks.map((m,i)=>i===week?m.map((n,k)=>k===teacherSubject?v:n):m)}:x))}}/></td><td><select aria-label={s.id+' feedback'} value={s.feedback||''} onChange={e=>setLearners(prev=>prev.map(x=>x.id===s.id?{...x,feedback:e.target.value}:x))}><option value="">No feedback</option><option>Revisit core concepts</option><option>Practise timed questions</option><option>Consistent progress — keep practising</option></select></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></div>}
